  10_system_change_and_style.md: debopty-first CLI (`schema --json` | `--dry-run` | `-y --non-interactive`) | Pure Bash `set -euo pipefail` & quoting/timeout | zero inline Here-Docs | `.d`/systemd drop-in preference | idempotency & `# managed-by-debopty` custom preservation
  20_security_and_credentials.md: 0700/0600 credential & runtime isolation | `debopty agent cred` stdin/file-only input | systemd `LoadCredential`/`LoadCredentialEncrypted`/`EnvironmentFile` + sandboxing | secret redaction | SSH/nftables/Fail2ban preflight & anti-lockout
  30_atomic_ops_and_audit.md: 5-step atomic ops loop (audit -> checkpoint -> preflight -> mutate & verify -> rollback) | `audit.jsonl` redacted NDJSON retention | 3-way SHA-256 lossless workspace upgrade
  40_memory_and_retention.md: CoALA 3-tier taxonomy | elastic scaling (0 / 1..15 / >15 sub-sharding + overflow INDEX.md) | fail-closed Write Gate (rc=21/22/23) | dedup verdicts | sleep-time consolidate & promote | BM25 cache | memory-tracking local vs tracked
